WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.978
Why do you keep missing?

00:00:02.433 --> 00:00:09.910
Technique Doctor reads your bar traces and your miss tags. Then it names the fault that keeps showing up.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:15.800
Each fault comes with a cue to think on your next rep. And the dates of the lifts that show it.

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:24.128
Browse every fault by lift. See the likely causes and the drills that fix them. It tells you where to film it, too.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:34.691
Free reads your last 5 lifts. Pro reads further back, so you can watch a fault shrink. Here, arms bent early fell from 76 to 62 percent.

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:38.941
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
